Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,Paula.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:02.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:04.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,Do you have a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:07.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,They went with someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:11.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,They did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:13.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:15.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,That is three now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:20.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Can I tell you something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:22.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,I am really not meant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:23.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:25.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:27.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,You gave the best answers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:28.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,in that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.77,0:00:31.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,Nobody else was even close
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.11,0:00:33.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,on the operations question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.47,0:00:34.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,But the note that came
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.65,0:00:35.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,back was,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:36.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,and these are their words,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.99,0:00:39.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,she seemed tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.71,0:00:41.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,We want someone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.77,0:00:42.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,with more energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.85,0:00:45.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Energy.
